WEBVTT

00:00:00.008 --> 00:00:02.947
We’ll build control flow in a logical order.

00:00:02.947 --> 00:00:10.417
First come Boolean conditions. Then we’ll use if, elif, and else to choose among outcomes.

00:00:10.417 --> 00:00:18.197
After that, for loops let us repeat over known items, while loops repeat while a condition remains true,

00:00:18.197 --> 00:00:26.084
and finally we combine these ideas in common analytics patterns such as classification, counting, and flagging.

00:00:26.583 --> 00:00:31.730
As you work through the examples, do not just ask whether the code runs.

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:40.485
Ask which condition becomes true, which block executes, and how the values change from one repetition to the next.
